QuestGuidance.Register("en",344,{
[10977]="700082D4\n1\tDefeat Pakonka, Siege-master\tThe armoured troll Pakonka can be found within Hîsuk in the shadow of the mountain overlooking the valley of Dol Dínen, far to the south-east of Esteldín. You should seek out the armoured captain of the trolls in Dol Dínen. With the death of their captain, the trolls will be thrown into disarray.\n2\tDefeat Pakonka, Siege-master\tThe armoured troll Pakonka can be found within Hîsuk in the shadow of the mountain overlooking the valley of Dol Dínen, far to the south-east of Esteldín. You should seek out the armoured captain of the trolls in Dol Dínen. With the death of their captain, the trolls will be thrown into disarray.\n3\tCompleted\tYou ventured deep into the heart of the Orc-encampment at Dol Dínen and defeated the troll siege-master, Pakonka.\n",
[10978]="700082D3\n1\tCollect ballista locks (total: 5)\030Collect catapult pinions (total: 5)\030Collect trebuchet swing-arms (total: 4)\tCatapults, trebuchets, and ballistae can be found on the hills and high ground deep within the Orc-encampment in Dol Dínen, south-east of Esteldín. You should destroy the siege-equipment in Dol Dínen.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have disabled the siege-craft in Dol Dínen, hindering the Ongbúrz march to war. The Rangers of Esteldín will be grateful for your endeavours.\n",
[10979]="70045FE8\n1\tFree trapped Gondorians (total: 8)\tYou should free any trapped Gondorians that you come across in the First Circle in Minas Tirith.\n2\tSpeak with Imrahil\tImrahil can be found outside the front gates of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Imrahil.\n",
[10980]="70047A5A\n1\tSearch rubble for black powder (total: 8)\tBlack powder may be found within the rubble surrounding the Slag-hills. You should collect black powder for Thurindol.\n2\tBring the black powder to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills. You should return to Thurindol with the black powder you gathered.\n",
[10981]="70020BAD\n1\tTalk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair\tThere are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair to the south of where you found the medallion. You should bring the medallion you found to one of the Rangers of the Grey Company.\n",
[10982]="70055E87\n1\tCollect Sigils of Imlad Ithil (total: 100)\tCollect 100 Sigils of Imlad Ithil to trade with the White Company Quartermaster. This quest can be completed weekly.\n2\tTalk to the White Company Quartermaster to trade Sigils of Imlad Ithil for Motes. This quest can be completed weekly.\t\n",
[10983]="7005449E\n1\tCollect gaunt-man sigils (total: 6)\tGaunt-men can be found in the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul. You should collect their sigils from them as they fall.\n2\tBring the gaunt-man sigils to Damrod in Barad Orhant\tDamrod can be found in Barad Orhant in Minas Morgul. You should bring the gaunt-man sigils to Damrod.\n",
[10984]="7001D0D3\n1\tPlace a Malledhrim war-banner in a contested camp\tContested camps can be found in Gathbúrz. Rodelleth has asked you to place a Malledhrim war-banner at a contested camp.\n2\tDefend the Malledhrim war-banner\tDefend the Malledhrim war-banner at the contested camp in Gathburz. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Rodelleth at Thangúlhad\tRodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should return to Rodelleth with news of your success.\n",
[10985]="7002BDE3\n1\tUse the Sigil of Orthanc in your inventory\tThe ancient forge of the Númenóreans is at the Ox-clan encampment in Nan Curunír. Andras gave you a worn Sigil of Orthanc and told you to deconstruct it at the ancient forge of the Númenóreans.\n",
[10986]="70020C8C\n1\tTalk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan\tSaeradan is at Echad Saeradan, west from Gwyllion's Gate. You should tell Saeradan of the banner you discovered.\n",
[10987]="7000AE1C\n1\tReturn the leather hides to Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg at Tol Ascarnen\030Collect leather hides (total: 10)\tWolves can be found throughout the forests south and east of Tol Ascarnen. Drakes can be found to the north in Arador's End. Aurochs can be found in the pastures south and east of Tol Ascarnen. In an effort to call defenders to the central keep of Tol Ascarnen, Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg has asked you to collect hides to weave into banners that will call the defenders to their posts at the southern bridge.\n",
[10988]="7000AE1D\n1\tReturn the leather hides to Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg at Tol Ascarnen\030Collect leather hides (total: 10)\tWolves can be found throughout the forests south and east of Tol Ascarnen. Drakes can be found to the north in Arador's End. Aurochs can be found in the pastures south and east of Tol Ascarnen. In an effort to call defenders to the central keep of Tol Ascarnen, Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg has asked you to collect hides to weave into banners that will call them to their posts at the western bridge.\n",
[10989]="70022925\n1\tFind equipment on Half-orc Bosses (0/2)\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads. There must be some bosses driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.\n2\tFind equipment on Half-orc Bosses (0/2)\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads. There must be some bosses driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.\n3\tFind equipment on Half-orc Bosses (1/2)\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads. There must be some bosses driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.\n4\tFind equipment on Half-orc Bosses (1/2)\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads. There must be some leaders driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.\n5\tTalk to Guladus Brehures at the Brenin's Hall\tGuladus Brehures is at the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch. Having found gear bearing the sign of the White Hand upon the half-orcs raiding Nan Laeglin, you may return to Guladus Brehures with the evidence she needs to speak out against Isengard in the Council of Brehur.\n",
[10990]="70025130\n1\tFind equipment on Half-orc Bosses (0/2)\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads. There must be some bosses driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.\n2\tFind equipment on Half-orc Bosses (0/2)\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads. There must be some bosses driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.\n3\tFind equipment on Half-orc Bosses (1/2)\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads. There must be some bosses driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.\n4\tFind equipment on Half-orc Bosses (1/2)\tHalf-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads. There must be some leaders driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.\n5\tTalk to Guladus Brehures at the Brenin's Hall\tGuladus Brehures is at the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch. Having found gear bearing the sign of the White Hand upon the half-orcs raiding Nan Laeglin, you may return to Guladus Brehures and present her with your trophies.\n",
[10991]="700413CB\n1\tSigns of hope may be scattered around Ringló Vale near Ethring. Search for signs of hope.\t\n2\tBring the signs of hope to Borhador\tBorhador can be found in The Crossing-hall. You should bring the signs of hope to Borhador.\n",
[10992]="7001B1CD\n1\tDeliver the cloth strips to Andreg at the Old Greenway Fort\030Collect strips of blood-stained cloth (total: 8)\tOrcs can be found along the eastern border of the Greenway, north of the Old Greenway Fort. Andreg awaits your return at his post near the Old Greenway Fort. Andreg has asked you to search the Orcs along the Greenway's eastern borders for signs of a struggle against the Men of the North Downs. Though the Rangers hope that the Orcs have not attacked the Men of the North Downs, they wish to investigate and ensure that this is not the case.\n",
[10993]="7002C6ED\n1\tFind Renfaer in Thinglad\tThinglad's scout can be found south-east from Haldirith. Limfind has asked you to find and help the scout Renfaer.\n",
[10994]="700398DE\n1\tTalk to Torwulf at the homestead south-east of Middlemead\tTorwulf can be found outside the farmhouse at the homestead south-east of Middlemead. Concerned by a lack of shipments, Folcbur has sent you to investigate the farm south-east of town and meet with a town guard also stationed there.\n2\tLook at the fields for sign of the Enemy\030Scout the windmill at the homestead\tThe windmill can be found at the southern end of Folcbur's homestead south-east of Middlemead. You have met with Torwulf and are now to scout the homestead for sign of the Enemy. You should look from atop the windmill.\n3\tSearch the farmhouse\tThe farmhouse is at the centre of the homestead to the south-east of Middlemead. You have found no sign of the Enemy and should rejoin Torwulf inside the farmhouse.\n4\tFind Torwulf\tTorwulf is somwhere inside the farmhouse at the homestead south-east of Middlemead. You have heard noises from within the farmhouse. You should try to find Torwulf.\n5\tTalk to Folcbur\tFolcbur can be found at the traders' pavillion in central Middlemead. You have defeated the traitorous warrior Folcbur sent you to meet, and should now reveal what you have learned of the homestead.\n",
[10995]="700169C8\n1\tDefeat Wargs at Athmadhul (total: 10)\tWargs can be found at Athmadhul, south-east of Mekhem-bizru. Ótam wants you to thin the numbers of the Wargs so there will be fewer Warg-riders to trouble the dwarves.\n2\tTalk to Ótam at Mekhem-bizru\tÓtam is at Mekhem-bizru, north-west of Athmadhul. Ótam will be pleased to hear that the Wargs around Athmadhul have been thinned.\n",
[10996]="70028C90\n1\tDefeat Dunlending sentries (total: 8)\tTravel south along the base of Dol Baran and look for sentries amongst the hills and valleys. You should seek out and defeat any Dunlending sentries that you encounter.\n2\tTalk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond.\tArdwyn is at Forthbrond, north of Brôntrig. You should return to Ardwyn and let him know that you have dealt with the sentries.\n",
[10997]="700216F5\n1\tDiscover Pruv Cadlus\030Defeat sentries near Pruv Cadlus (total: 6)\030Discover Sarf Cadlus\030Defeat sentries near Sarf Cadlus (total: 6)\tThe Draig-lûth camps are east and north-east of Harndirion. Gronu has asked you to seek out Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus on the eastern slope below Harndirion and defeat sentries at each of the camps.\n2\tTalk to Gronu at his camp\tGronu's camp lies almost due north of Harndirion. You should return to Gronu and let him know that you have defeated many of the sentries near Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus.\n",
[10998]="7002512F\n1\tDiscover Pruv Cadlus\030Defeat sentries near Pruv Cadlus (total: 6)\030Discover Sarf Cadlus\030Defeat sentries near Sarf Cadlus (total: 6)\tThe Draig-lûth camps are east and north-east of Harndirion. Gronu has asked you to seek out Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus on the eastern slope below Harndirion and defeat sentries at each of the camps.\n2\tTalk to Gronu at his camp\tGronu's camp lies almost due north of Harndirion. You should return to Gronu and let him know that you have defeated many of the sentries near Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus.\n",
[10999]="7006BB04\n1\tFind the western Orc outpost\tFind the Orc outpost to the west of Maurûsh that was discovered by the scouts.\n2\tDefeat Orcs in western outpost (total: 5)\tDefeat the Orcs at the western outpost to help Galâmka in their preparations for the battle in Maurûsh.\n3\tFind the southern Orc outpost\tFind the Orc outpost to the south of Maurûsh that was discovered by the scouts.\n4\tDefeat Orcs in southern outpost (total: 5)\tDefeat the Orcs at the southern outpost to help Galâmka in their preparations for the battle in Maurûsh.\n5\tFind the eastern Orc outpost\tFind the Orc outpost to the east of Maurûsh that was discovered by the scouts.\n6\tDefeat Orcs in eastern outpost (total: 5)\tDefeat the Orcs at the eastern outpost to help Galâmka in their preparations for the battle in Maurûsh.\n7\tReturn to Galâmka in Ub Nishir\tReturn to Galâmka in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh and inform him that the outposts have been cleared out.\n",
[11000]="7004A8CA\n1\tFind and follow the Silent One's path in Dath Nethryn\tThe Silent One can be found somewhere within Dath Nethryn. You and Legolas have tracked the Silent One to Dath Nethryn. You should now search for the Silent One in the swamp.\n2\tFind and defeat the Silent One\tThe Silent One can be found somewhere within Kâm Lagúrz in Dath Nethryn. You have followed the Silent One's tracks into Kâm Lagúrz where the corpse of an enormous spider now rests. You should search for the Silent One.\n3\tDeliver the Silent One's armour to Legolas near Dath Nethryn\tLegolas can be found above the swamp of Dath Nethryn in Lhingris. You have defeated the Silent One and taken his armour. You should now return to Legolas.\n",
[11001]="7000E4E0\n1\tDestroy Gauradan-traps (total: 8)\tThe aurochs-herds are to the north and to the south and south-west of Jänis-leiri. Niko instructed you to find and disable some of the Gauredain's traps to protect the aurochs-herds.\n2\tTalk to Niko\tNiko is at Jänis-leiri, northward of the aurochs-herds, near the road. You should return to Niko and tell him of your success.\n",
[11002]="7001B245\n1\tSearch for signs of Gollum at the Pool of Tranquility\tGollum might be found at one of several locations suggested by Miluimil. Miluimil has asked you to search for any signs of Gollum in the Scuttledells. You should start with the Pool of Tranquility.\n2\tSearch for signs of Gollum at the Low Pond\tGollum might be found at one of several locations suggested by Miluimil. Miluimil has asked you to search for any signs of Gollum in the Scuttledells. Perhaps you should try the Low Pond.\n3\tSearch for signs of Gollum at the Crawling Waters\tGollum might be found at one of several locations suggested by Miluimil. Miluimil has asked you to search for any signs of Gollum in the Scuttledells. Perhaps you should try the Crawling Waters.\n4\tTalk to Miluimil at Ivorel's camp\tMiluimil is at Ivorel's camp in the Scuttledells. You should return to Miluimil and tell him what you have learned of Gollum's whereabouts.\n",
[11003]="70030F47\n1\tTalk to Gísil in the Mead Hall of Garsfeld\tThane Gísil can be found at Garsfeld, among the northernmost crofts of the Sutcrofts. Léofmar wishes for you to travel to Garsfeld in the Sutcrofts and aid his brethren.\n",
[11004]="700272AF\n1\tTalk to Thurbald\tThe Rohirrim scouts Thurbald and Cuthric are somewhere in the northern reaches of the Gravenwood, while Elfrith returned south to watch the road into Wulf's Cleft. Léofward has asked you to find the scouts he sent out into the Gravenwood and make sure they are well.\n2\tAssist Thurbald with Breath of the Dragon\030Assist Thurbald with Into the Dragon's Maw\030Assist Thurbald with Pulling the Dragon's Teeth\tThurbald is hiding outside a Dragon-clan encampment, north of the Rohirrim scout-camp. Thurbald needs your help with several tasks.\n3\tTalk to Cuthric\tThe Rohirrim scouts Thurbald and Cuthric are somewhere in the northern reaches of the Gravenwood, while Elfrith returned south to watch the road into the Isendale. Léofward has asked you to find the scouts he sent out into the Gravenwood and make sure they are well.\n4\tAssist Cuthric with Charge of the Ox\030Assist Cuthric with Heading off the Stampede\030Assist Cuthric with Prime Cut\tCuthric is hiding outside an Ox-clan encampment, west of the Rohirrim scout-camp. Cuthric needs your assistance with some tasks.\n5\tTalk to Elfrith\tThe Rohirrim scouts Thurbald and Cuthric are somewhere in the northern reaches of the Gravenwood, while Elfrith returned south to watch the road into the Isendale. Léofward has asked you to find the scouts he sent out into the Gravenwood and make sure they are well.\n6\tAssist Elfrith with Clear-cutting Orcs\030Assist Elfrith with Trophies of the Enemy\030Assist Elfrith with Wanton Destruction\tElfrith is hiding outside and Orc-camp, south-west of the Rohirrim scout-camp. Elfrith needs your assistance with some tasks.\n7\tTalk to Léofward at the Rohirrim scout-camp\tLéofward is at the Rohirrim scout-camp. You should return to Léofward with the information provided to you by the Rohirrim scouts.\n",
[11005]="70071B46\n1\tTBD Return to Quest Giver\tTBD Return to Quest Bestower\n",
[11006]="7000838E\n1\tBring the spider-silk to Aarnikka\030Collect skeins of spider-silk (total: 10)\tThere are spiders throughout Ram Dúath. Aarnikka has asked you to collect silk from the spiders of the Ram Dúath.\n",
[11007]="7001EFEF\n1\tCollect pristine webbing (total: 25)\tSpiders can be found throughout the Scuttledells in Mirkwood. Legindir has asked you to collect pristine webbing from the spiders and environs of the Scuttledells.\n2\tTalk to Legindir at Ost Galadh\t\n",
[11008]="7005FF8E\n1\tCollect Silver Coins of Gundabad (total: 100)\tCollect 100 Silver Coins of Gundabad to trade with the Reclaimers of the Mountain-hold Quartermaster. This quest can be completed weekly.\n2\tTalk to the Reclaimers of the Mountain-hold Quartermaster to trade Silver Coins of Gundabad for Motes. This quest can be completed weekly.\t\n",
})
